# In front of a Pokemon Centre's PC, facing it.
#
# The PC has no bg event and no object: it is a tile behaviour, and
# Field_TileBehaviorToScript only answers for it when the player is facing
# NORTH, so the tile south of it and FACE_UP are both part of the recipe. The
# two tiles are at (12,2) and (12,3) of the shared Pokemon Centre interior,
# found by scanning the loaded map rather than by reading the matrices.

name BOXER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 30121
money 6000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
party SPECIES_BIDOOF 8 ITEM_NONE
party SPECIES_STARLY 9 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_1F 12 4 FACE_UP
